From 8bfbe66fb513da7208a0f23fc4ea71c6f60b461b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: pranshu <snpranshukhtk99@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 14:54:33 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] feat(cad): implement interactive 2D CAD parameter editing
 (Task I)

- Add in-place QLineEdit overlay on double-click for editable parameters
- Support editing Carriageway Width, Girder Spacing, Deck Thickness, and Span Length
- Keep Overhang, Overall Bridge Width, and Bracing Spacing locked as read-only
- Validate input using BridgeInputValidator for numeric, zero, negative, and engineering limits
- Commit on Enter and click-outside; revert on Escape or validation failure
- Synchronize updated values with input dictionaries, UI dock widgets, and trigger CAD redraw
